# Cross-origin isolation, site-wide: the resident demo needs
# SharedArrayBuffer, which requires COOP + COEP. Every asset this site
# loads is same-origin, so the blanket policy is safe — but any future
# cross-origin embed must carry CORP/CORS headers or it will be blocked.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
